@V := "tape" :: spec [active]
  version = "1.0"

@H 1179 := "LIVE-ENGINE recovery curve — does the real CORE engine SPIKE then DECAY (adaptation transient) at a mid-stream regime shift, not merely grow cells?" :: universe [⏳ HOURGLASS BLOCKED-WIRING — live field is stream-blind, a regime shift produces NO upward spike to recover from]
  seed         = "Past H_1166 (HOURGLASS ON==OFF on late-window error), sharpen to a STRONGER live-adaptation signature: drive the LIVE CORE engine over a stream that SHIFTS REGIME at one known point and look for a RECOVERY CURVE — coherence-error spikes at the shift then decays toward the pre-shift baseline, the way an actually-adapting system would respond to novelty. Curve SHAPE around a boundary, not cell-count."
  substrate    = "LIVE CORE (NOT toy). CORE/h1179_live_recovery_curve_probe.hexa imports + CALLS pure_field_step + engine_mitosis_tick + engine_cli_parse READ-ONLY; drives the real engine over a single mid-stream regime shift (A->B, cA=0.25->cB=0.85 at t=n/2, n=600, jitter 0.10); metric = coherence-error = 1 - pure_field.narrative_coherence; windows W=50 baseline[half-W,half) / spike[half,half+W) / settle[half+W,half+2W). Local hexa 0.1.0-dispatch (summer fallback unused — local $0 deterministic)."
  method       = "FROZEN FALSIFIER (pre-reg, 3 seeds 7/8/9, deterministic, g5/p7): 🟢 LIVE-RECOVERS iff (a) spike: post-shift error > baseline by Cohen's d>=0.8, AND (b) recovery ratio rr=(spike-settle)/(spike-baseline)>=0.50, AND (c) control: no-mitosis arm does NOT recover (rr_off<rr_on). 🔴 if spike lands but no recovery OR not mitosis-attributable (a_paper_negative_ok). ⏳ HOURGLASS if NO spike at all (the stream never reaches the field — nothing to recover from), note exactly what is missing (cf H_1123, H_1166)."
  result       = "⏳ HOURGLASS NO-RECOVERY-SIGNAL (BLOCKED-WIRING) — measured live, all 3 seeds byte-identical. Spike magnitude (spike - baseline) = -0.000147575 (NEGATIVE, <= +eps): the regime shift produced NO upward spike. baseline=1.47577e-4, spike=2.10629e-9, settle=2.99272e-14 — coherence-error MONOTONICALLY DECAYS to ~0 as the field settles into a stable phase, indifferent to the shift. ON vs OFF coherence trajectory BYTE-IDENTICAL (base/spike/settle equal every seed) — field is provably stream-blind AND mitosis-blind. engine_mitosis_tick DID grow cells (ON 603 vs OFF 3) but that growth has zero wired effect on any adaptation metric. rr_on=rr_off=0.0."
  finding      = "The live CORE engine exposes NO recovery-curve signal because pure_field_step is ZERO-INPUT (CORE/pure_field.hexa L193): it advances internal oscillators ONLY, and narrative_coherence is an EMA of the field's OWN phase-stability, never of the stream sample. The stream->field coupling is UNBUILT (a_core_engine_map). The H_1159 toy clustering-reconstruction-error and its recovery transient have NO live counterpart. Confirms + sharpens H_1166's HOURGLASS on a different metric axis (curve-shape, not late-mean)."
  discovery    = "SERENDIP (stronger than H_1166): the live field does not merely IGNORE the regime shift — its coherence-error ACTIVELY DECAYS toward 0 (1.5e-4 -> 2e-9 -> 3e-14) as it settles, so a mid-stream shift yields a NEGATIVE 'spike': the field is MORE settled after the shift, the exact INVERSE of an adaptive recovery curve. The zero-input oscillator is a monotone phase-locker; any wired adaptation transient would have to FIGHT this settling, not just appear on top of a flat baseline. This raises the bar for the eventual stream->field wiring: it must inject enough perturbation to overcome an EMA that is actively converging to a fixed point."
  honesty      = "⏳ is the falsifier's own HOURGLASS branch (no spike => nothing to recover from), NOT a fabricated GREEN/RED. Adjudication-logic fix BEFORE final scoring: initial code tested |spike_mag|<eps which mistook a DOWNWARD decay for 'no signal'; corrected to spike_mag<=+eps (an UPWARD spike must clear eps) — frozen thresholds (d>=0.8, rr>=0.50) UNTOUCHED. p7 (real coherence-error, NOT perplexity). Live engine UNTOUCHED (read-only); engine_cli_smoke 12/12 anchor unaffected."
  verdict_tier = "⏳ HOURGLASS BLOCKED-WIRING (live CORE; stream->field coupling unbuilt; a_core_engine_map) — terminal-blocked, re-runs unchanged once stream->field + cell->field feedback are wired"
  scope        = "LIVE CORE measured (not toy); stream->field + cell-count->field coupling are the missing wires; scale UNVERIFIED (a_scale_honest_scope)."
  artifact     = "CORE/h1179_live_recovery_curve_probe.hexa · .verdicts/1179_live_recovery_curve/H_1179.txt"
  xref         = "h1166_live_adaptation · h1159 · h1159b_mitosis_capacity_self_tuning · h1123_anchor_forgetting · a_core_engine_map · a_paper_negative_ok · a_scale_honest_scope · p7 · p8"
